# [Speech to Speech](https://docs.x.ai/developers/model-capabilities/audio/speech-to-speech#speech-to-speech)
## [Using Tools with Grok Speech to Speech API](https://docs.x.ai/developers/model-capabilities/audio/speech-to-speech#using-tools-with-grok-speech-to-speech-api)
### [Collections Search with `file_search`](https://docs.x.ai/developers/model-capabilities/audio/speech-to-speech#collections-search-with-file_search)
```
const COLLECTION_ID = "your-collection-id"; // Replace with your collection ID

const sessionConfig = {
    type: "session.update",
    session: {
        ...
        tools: [\
            {\
                type: "file_search",\
                vector_store_ids: [COLLECTION_ID],\
                max_num_results: 10,\
            },\
        ],
    },
};
```

### [Web Search and X Search](https://docs.x.ai/developers/model-capabilities/audio/speech-to-speech#web-search-and-x-search)
```
session_config = {
    "type": "session.update",
    "session": {
        ...
        "tools": [\
            {\
                "type": "web_search",\
                "allowed_domains": ["x.ai", "docs.x.ai"],\
                "location": {"country": "US", "city": "San Francisco"},\
            },\
            {\
                "type": "x_search",\
                "allowed_x_handles": ["xai"],\
                "from_date": "2025-01-01",\
                "to_date": "2025-06-01",\
            },\
        ],
    },
}
```

